  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA distributed value fell 2.9% over 30D:</strong> On-chain RWA distributed value at $15.77B (2.9% lower over 30D) hints that tokenized asset growth paused or reversed\u2014more consistent with risk-off allocation or redemptions than a pure news cycle. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/defi/2026-09-10-uniswap-stablepair-hook-414160\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Uniswap launches \u2018StablePair Hook\u2019 to help LPs capture more stablecoin trading value</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Tokenized U.S. Treasuries remain the institutional bridge into RWAs:</strong> adoption is strongest where products plug into cash management, collateral, and liquidity workflows. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Tokenization Briefing: Tokenized Treasuries Grew 75% in 2026</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Institutional commitments are still a leading share signal:</strong> Bank and asset-manager distribution deals often shift platform and network leadership before headline RWA totals fully catch up. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/09/10/monument-bank-delays-retail-tokenized-deposits-cites-regulatory-issues-in-the-uk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Monument Bank delays retail tokenized deposits while onboarding custody partner</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Clearer rules tend to unlock balance-sheet participation and collateral workflows even when aggregate on-chain totals reprice slowly. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/09/10/europe-s-top-regulator-questions-polymarket-and-kalshi-s-eu-access-warns-of-authorization-gaps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Europe\u2019s top regulator questions Polymarket and Kalshi\u2019s EU access, warns of authorization gaps</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
